      <div class="ck-steps four">
        <div><span>Fuel</span><b>What you eat</b><p>One table you choose, and why you chose it.</p><em class="kc">24 keys · Meaning</em></div>
        <div><span>Fitness</span><b>How you move</b><p>A dose sized to your worst week, not your best.</p><em class="kc">33 keys · Body</em></div>
        <div><span>Sleep</span><b>How you rest</b><p>The hours, the light, the recovery between.</p><em class="kc">8 keys · Awareness</em></div>
        <div><span>Schedule</span><b>When you do it</b><p>Same time, same place. Rhythm beats intensity.</p><em class="kc">10 keys · You</em></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>
